x;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are looking for a free keyword search tool to get query suggestions based on the provided keywords, then <a href=\"https:\/\/soovle.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Soovle<\/a> is your one-stop solution. It scours multiple platforms, such as Bing, Google, Amazon, Yahoo, YouTube, Wikipedia, and more, to provide you with keyword suggestions you might have overlooked.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It can generate hundreds of suggestions within seconds and display results by website, so you can optimize content for each keyword. You can also use it for future reference or download suggestions in a CSV file. Another feature is an alphabetical list of top keywords with the platforms on which each one is ranked highly.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"598\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/soovle-free-keyword-search-tool-1024x598.webp\" alt=\"soovle free keyword search tool\" class=\"wp-image-7319\" style=\"width:768px;height:449px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/soovle-free-keyword-search-tool-1024x598.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/soovle-free-keyword-search-tool-300x175.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/soovle-free-keyword-search-tool-768x449.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/soovle-free-keyword-search-tool.webp 1030w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/soovle-free-keyword-search-tool-150x88.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">20+ Key SEO Skills You Need to Succeed<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Ahrefs<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"538\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/ahrefs-1024x538.webp\" alt=\"Ahrefs\" class=\"wp-image-7204\" style=\"width:276px;height:145px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/ahrefs-1024x538.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/ahrefs-300x158.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/ahrefs-768x403.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/ahrefs-150x79.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/ahrefs.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/ahrefs.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Ahrefs<\/a> is almost similar to SEMrush but has some additional features and a more intuitive design. For example, sometimes, Google provides instant answers for a few queries, so not every search turns into page visits. Using Clicks and Clicks Per Search metrics, you can find keywords that generate website traffic and skip dead-end options.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Its database has over 7 million keywords from 171 countries, and each month, the platform updates new keywords in the database. It shares keywords and their search volumes after combining various popular search engines and platforms, including Amazon, YouTube, Google, Baidu, and Bing. It means it identifies opportunities that many other tools might miss.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use Ahrefs for competitive research, and its Site Explorer tool helps you figure out competitors&#8217; keyword strategies. Moreover, using the Content Gap feature, you can compare competitor keywords with yours to find what you are missing.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It uses the Keyword Difficulty (KD) score to guide users on how challenging it can be to rank certain keywords on search engines. It calculates scores using present high-ranking pages. Ahrefs is now among the most reliable keywords search tools that allow searches for multiple keywords simultaneously.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you input different keywords, it gives thousands of ideas in different ways. It matches terms or phrases that include your target keywords and gives ideas based on one or more keywords.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It notifies you about every ranking progress of your competitors, no matter how small it is. One of the strongest features of the tool is backlink research. We can conclude that Ahrefs stands out for its freshness, usability, and index size.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Ubersuggest<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"850\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/ubersuggest.webp\" alt=\"Ubersuggest\" class=\"wp-image-6263\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.7027027027027026;width:242px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/ubersuggest.webp 850w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/ubersuggest-300x176.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/ubersuggest-768x452.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 850px) 100vw, 850px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/neilpatel.com\/ubersuggest\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Ubersuggest<\/a> is a free keyword generator that can find short-tail and long-tail keywords within seconds. You can download it and add it as an extension to your browser and use it for various purposes, such as search volume data, keyword suggestions, keyword density, and keyword difficulty.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It can provide the top SEO pages report so you can understand how competitors\u2019 pages are working. You can see all the relevant keywords and find which are generating the most clicks. Use this free tool to get a list of hundreds of keywords with seasonal trends, competition, and volume. Also, you can check the content that is ranked top to compose your own content around similar keywords.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As we know, backlinks directly impact search engine rankings. That is where Ubbersuggest can be of great help. It shows you details about where businesses are backlinking their articles on the website so you can approach them to link their articles or pages on your site. This will enhance your link profile and speed up your business growth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is one of the top keyword research tools with plans for individuals, businesses, and agencies. You can seek help from its support team via emails or biweekly calls. Moreover, once you sign up for this tool, you can access Google Search Console and seek better support services from the team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3568cff12edd1091b5a414a41fd6a290\"><strong>Essential SEO Topics You Should Know<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Keywords Types in SEO<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/local-seo-ranking-factors\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Local SEO Ranking Factors<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-kpis\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO KPIs<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo-checklist\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Technical SEO Checklist<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/link-building-mistakes\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Link Building Mistakes<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo-factors\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">On Page SEO Factors<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/ai-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI SEO Tools<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo-checklist\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">On Page SEO Checklist<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. KeywordTool.io<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"141\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool-1024x141.webp\" alt=\"KeywordTool.io\" class=\"wp-image-7203\" style=\"width:270px;height:36px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool-1024x141.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool-300x41.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool-768x105.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool-1536x211.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool-150x21.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/keywordtool.webp 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/keywordtool.io\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Keyword Tool<\/a> is a rudimentary keyword research tool but a perfect choice if you simply want long-tail keywords related to the one you have already thought of. It is completely free, and you don\u2019t need to create an account to use this tool.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This tool uses Google Autocomplete to provide users with a list of relevant keyword suggestions with required data that SEO experts need, such as search volume, competition, and trend information.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The suggestions are based on different factors, including how often people have searched for a specific term in the past. You can filter results according to your requirements, such as region, platform, language, type, etc.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want keyword research tools for SEO free of cost, then Keyword Tool is certainly one of the top choices. It is listed among the most in-demand<strong> <\/strong>SEO tools<strong> <\/strong>as it helps users understand what people are searching for around different topics.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Hence, bloggers can rely on it to brainstorm new and unique blog ideas. Similar to other tools, it also allows users to analyze competitors and find words they are ranking for.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Its free version is sufficient to find keyword suggestions, but you need to upgrade to the paid version to know about search volume and cost-per-click.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8. MOZ Keyword Explorer<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"335\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/moz.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6298\" style=\"width:253px;height:113px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/moz.webp 335w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/moz-300x134.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 335px) 100vw, 335px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Being a marketer, you must have heard of <a href=\"https:\/\/moz.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">MOZ<\/a> at some point. It\u2019s a leading tool that can perform extensive keyword research in no time and provide high-impact suggestions. You can also use it to find keywords for your business to rank your website higher on search engine result pages.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>One feature that makes it one of the best SEO tools for keyword research is that it allows users to export CSV files. You can easily download the MOZ bar, which appears at the top of your computer screen and allows you to check the page and domain authority, shares of a website, spam score, and much more.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It ensures more than 95% accuracy in terms of search volume, so you can prioritize keywords according to topics using the scoring system.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can filter keywords by location and other parameters for strategic keyword planning. As you perform a keyword search using MOZ, it shows a list of relevant keywords along with their difficulty level to rank, potential, opportunity, and other aspects. You can also see the top ten organization results for a specific keyword with its Facebook shares and links to the page and domain.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can analyze, download, and apply keyword suggestions for future use. It also shows keywords in the form of questions, long-tail keywords with high competition, and related topics. Many of MOZ\u2019s features are available with only the paid subscription, but its Keyword Explorer allows three free searches every day to users signed up for a free account.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n